X86 VW+xchg
"Expected: Forbidden. Source: derivation (the locked XCHG writes s to memory before the store of z). x86 analogue of VW+ldaddl. UNVERIFIED -- run herd7"
{ s=0; z=0; }
 P0           | P1          ;
 MOV EAX,$1   | MOV EAX,[z] ;
 XCHG [s],EAX | MOV EBX,[s] ;
 MOV [z],$1   |             ;
exists (1:EAX=1 /\ 1:EBX=0)
